      "title": "Australia news live: Israeli embassy condemns flydubai ‘false flag’ conspiracies; Melbourne soaked by wettest day since 2024",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/live/2026/oct/02/labor-anthony-albanese-online-gaming-esafety-coalition-angus-taylor-greens-david-shoebridge-ntwnfb",
      "description": "<p>Follow the day’s news live</p><ul><li><p>Get our <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/email-newsletters?CMP=cvau_sfl\">breaking news email</a>, <a href=\"https://app.adjust.com/w4u7jx3\">free app</a> or <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/series/full-story?CMP=cvau_sfl\">daily news podcast</a></p></li></ul><p>A Sydney man has been charged after allegedly restraining, choking and sexually assaulting a young woman in a park, <strong>Australian Associated Press</strong> reports.</p><p>A 23-year-old woman was walking from Flemington Station through Airey Park in Homebush, in Sydney’s west, around 11.15pm on Friday 18 September when she was stopped by a man not known to her, police say.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/live/2026/oct/02/labor-anthony-albanese-online-gaming-esafety-coalition-angus-taylor-greens-david-shoebridge-ntwnfb\">Continue reading...</a>",
